Alembic migrations for the Autonomous Maintenance Console.

Run every command from the `backend/` directory:

  uv run alembic upgrade head                          # apply migrations
  uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "message"  # generate a new one
  uv run alembic downgrade -1                          # roll one back
  uv run alembic current                               # show applied revision

DATABASE_URL is read from the environment (see the repository .env.example);
it is never written into alembic.ini.
